{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"houfei-e-o033b","title":"郭氏参与曹丕定嗣谋议","accounts":[{"id":"houfei-e-o033b-account","label":"《后妃传》正文","text":"文帝定为嗣，郭氏有谋。","evidence":["houfei-e-o033b-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wendi-p0021","role":"献谋","evidence":["houfei-e-o033b-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"文帝定为嗣时","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["houfei-e-o033b-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"houfei-e-o033b-q","source_order":[5,155,"O033b"],"order":1424}],"persons":[{"id":"wendi-p0021","name":"郭皇后（曹丕后）","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"houfei-e-o033b-q","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-a8f53ef0211177584830","layer":"original","quote":"文德郭皇后，安平广宗人也〖1〗。祖世长吏。﹝一﹞后少而父永奇之曰：“此乃吾女中王也！。”遂以“女王”为字。早失二亲，丧乱流离，没在铜鞮侯家〖2〗。太祖为魏公时，得入东宫〖3〗。后有智数，时时有所献纳〖4〗；文帝定为嗣，后有谋焉。","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":154,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":114,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
